WEBVTT

00:00:05.909 --> 00:00:11.909
Choose Users in the side menu.

00:00:12.709 --> 00:00:18.709
Type "kelechi" in the Search
by email or profile name box.

00:00:23.071 --> 00:00:29.071
Click Search.

00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:35.765
Click kelechi@example.test
to open the account.

00:00:38.727 --> 00:00:44.727
Scroll to Support actions.

00:00:45.331 --> 00:00:50.734
Click Delete account.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:56.984
Type "DELETE" in the Type
DELETE to confirm box.

00:01:00.073 --> 00:01:06.073
Click Delete account to confirm.
